    "https://nscad.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FINAL-AC_26.27.pdf": {
      "title": "26/27",
      "description": "26/27  \nNSCAD\nACADEMIC \nCALENDAR  \nNSCAD  UNIVERSITY  3\n\nNSCAD  UNIVERSITY  54   ACADEMIC CATALOGUE  2024/25\nIMPORTANT ACADEMIC DATES 06\nLAND ACKNOWLEDGEMENT 10\nPEOPLES’ ACKNOWLEDGEMENT 10\nPURPOSE 10\nTHE OFFFICE OF STUDENT EXPERIENCE (OSE) 11\nDEFINITIONS 11\nIMPORTANT POLICIES 13\nACADEMIC REGULATIONS 15\nACCOMMODATIONS FOR STUDENTS \nEXPERIENCING DISABILITIES 24\nACADEMIC INTEGRITY AND PLAGIARISM 25\nALTERNATIVE PROGRAMS 82\nUNDERGRADUATE PROGRAMS 28\nFoundation Y ear  . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 30\nStandard Foundation Y ear - First Semester  . . . . . . . . . . . . 30\nStandard Foundation Y ear - Second Semester  . . . . . . . . . . 31\nBachelor of Arts: Major in Art History (Studio)  . . . . . . . . . . 32\nBachelor of Arts: Major in Art History (Non-Studio)  . . . . . . . . 33\nBachelor of Design: Major in Interdisciplinary Design  . . . . 34\nBachelor of Fine Arts: Major in Ceramics   . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 36\nBachelor of Fine Arts: Major in Expanded Media   . . . . . . . . 37\nBachelor of Fine Arts: Major in Film  . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 38\nBachelor of Fine Arts: Major in Fine Art  . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 39\nBachelor of Fine Arts: Major in Interdisciplinary Arts   . . . . 40\nBachelor of Fine Arts: Major in Jewellery Design  \nand Metalsmithing  . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 41\nBachelor of Fine Arts: Major in Photography   . . . . . . . . . . . 42\nBachelor of Fine Arts: Major in T extiles/Fashion  . . . . . . . . 43\nMINOR PROGRAMS 44\nMinor in Animation  . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 45\nMinor in Art Education  . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 45\nMinor in Art History   . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 46\nMinor in Ceramics  . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 46\nMinor in Drawing  . . . . . .